---
title: One studio, five divisions
date: 2026-11-17
summary: БОГMODE is now one studio with five divisions, each with its own totem. Drones get a full program, SWARM, that goes Plan → Simulate → Fly.
art: divisions
---

Everything I build now sits in one of five divisions.

- **Swarm** (wolf): drones
- **Worlds** (dragon): games and 3D
- **Lab** (hare): science
- **Tools** (bear): data and AI
- **Ventures** (manticore): products

**SWARM is a program, not just a folder.** It runs Plan (Mission Planner) → Simulate (Drone Sim) → Fly (DroneWashers). Each stage's page shows where it sits in the pipeline.

The Work page is grouped by division now, and every project shows which one it belongs to.
